Update assessment forms (housing, socioeconomic, work-income, education, health, community-support, social-health-summary).

Usage: acdg assessment <subcommand> [arguments]
-h, --help    Print this usage information.

Available subcommands:
  community-support       Update the community-support-network ficha (7 required scalars: 6 bools + familyConflicts as String).
  education               Update the educational-status ficha (single-profile shortcut via flags; multiple profiles or programOccurrences[] only via --from-yaml).
  health                  Update the health-status ficha (--food-insecurity required; deficiencies[]/gestatingMembers[] only via --from-yaml).
  housing                 Update the housing-condition ficha (15 required fields).
  social-health-summary   Update the social-health summary ficha (3 required bools + optional functional-dependency multi-option).
  socioeconomic           Update the socio-economic situation ficha (5 required scalars + optional socialBenefits[] via --from-yaml).
  work-income             Update the work-and-income ficha (--has-retired-members required; individualIncomes[]/socialBenefits[] only via --from-yaml).

